01:31.740 --> 01:34.260
I'm not the Son of God.

01:34.260 --> 01:36.260
Carlos Santana,

01:36.260 --> 01:39.580
a player who possesses both composure and technique.

01:40.240 --> 01:43.620
I'll finally play against you in the second half!

01:44.580 --> 01:46.380
He kicked with his left foot!

01:48.130 --> 01:48.540
What?!

01:48.820 --> 01:50.780
Goal! 3-1!

01:53.540 --> 01:58.260
Then, Santana scored with a Rolling Overhead Kick over Tsubasa's head.

01:59.420 --> 02:02.500
When Tsubasa scored the second goal with his Flying Drive Shot,

02:02.900 --> 02:06.540
Santana answered with a Flying Drive Shot of his own from 30 meters away.

02:07.230 --> 02:13.170
It's as if Santana is trying to prove that his technique is better than Tsubasa's!

02:14.140 --> 02:17.180
Yes, he's showing off his superior skill to Tsubasa.

02:18.180 --> 02:21.180
Domingo's Santana tries to tie the game by advancing to the goal!

02:21.180 --> 02:22.850
He gets into shooting position!

02:25.190 --> 02:28.340
Goal! 3-3!

02:28.340 --> 02:31.860
Domingo has finally tied the match!

02:34.360 --> 02:37.530
He doesn't even break into a smile after scoring...

02:37.530 --> 02:40.330
Isn't soccer fun for you?

02:40.330 --> 02:42.940
If that's true...

02:42.940 --> 02:44.180
Santana!

02:44.180 --> 02:47.180
I'll teach you the joy of soccer!

02:49.440 --> 02:51.220
Teach me soccer?

02:51.560 --> 02:54.740
Did Santana just smile?

02:55.440 --> 02:56.740
Let's go, guys!

02:56.740 --> 02:58.260
Yeah!

02:58.710 --> 03:02.230
No matter how powerful and skillful you are,

03:02.230 --> 03:05.180
soccer without trusting your 
teammates around you is wrong!

03:05.900 --> 03:09.420
I won't lose to your soccer style!

03:15.380 --> 03:20.500
<b>The Shine of the Rosary</b>

03:15.380 --> 03:20.500
<b>The Shine of the Rosary</b>

03:23.120 --> 03:26.080
You said you would teach me soccer.

03:26.080 --> 03:31.020
Interesting. Then I will teach you the might of God.

03:36.130 --> 03:39.480
Your God will not answer your prayers.

03:39.480 --> 03:42.340
For the Lord taketh away, hence...

03:43.980 --> 03:50.780
your foolish prayers, your dreams, everything...

03:51.220 --> 03:53.260
shall be taken by me.

03:53.260 --> 03:55.780
Take this, Tsubasa!

04:06.180 --> 04:07.420
The ball is heading towards the goal!

04:09.660 --> 04:11.140
Play on!

04:11.140 --> 04:15.360
The ball hit Tsubasa's hand, but the referee decides to let the play continue!

04:15.360 --> 04:17.140
They will play on!

04:20.000 --> 04:21.140
The goalkeeper reacts to it!

04:21.890 --> 04:24.460
The ball barely misses the goal and hits the crossbar!

04:26.580 --> 04:28.620
Oh! Santana jumps!

04:36.680 --> 04:40.580
Goal! 4-3!

04:40.580 --> 04:42.900
Domingo finally takes the lead!

04:48.130 --> 04:54.140
Santana, The Son of God, scores the fourth goal as if he is taking the game from Tsubasa!

04:56.200 --> 04:58.140
Is Tsubasa all right?

04:58.140 --> 05:00.820
He took a powerful shot.

05:00.820 --> 05:02.690
It seems he hurt his shoulder.

05:02.690 --> 05:06.140
Damn, he purposely aimed for Tsubasa's arm!

05:14.240 --> 05:16.580
God does not answer prayers.

05:18.710 --> 05:26.140
Even if you strip off my misanga, you will never strip me of my dreams!

05:33.800 --> 05:40.860
Santana, I can't allow myself to lose someone who has abandoned his dreams and hopes!

05:41.830 --> 05:45.130
Even so, you will lose.

05:52.460 --> 05:55.240
Soccer is everything to Santana.

05:57.080 --> 06:00.910
He chose soccer over everything else he had.

06:02.700 --> 06:06.800
It happened during the International Junior Youth Tournament's championship game.

06:11.740 --> 06:16.340
He's done it! He's done it again, Carlos Balá!

06:16.340 --> 06:18.460
He's truly a one-man team!

06:18.460 --> 06:22.340
The new star who appeared like a comet

06:22.340 --> 06:26.460
led Brazil to victory in the International Junior Youth Tournament!

06:29.460 --> 06:32.220
This is only the beginning.

06:32.220 --> 06:37.980
I need him to make me more money as the star player for Balá FC.

06:38.530 --> 06:41.390
As people started to call him the "Soccer Cyborg",

06:41.390 --> 06:46.270
Santana became even colder... and stronger.

06:49.980 --> 06:53.960
Congratulations for winning the International Junior Youth Tournament.

06:53.960 --> 06:56.220
Let's start with Carlos Balá-san.

06:59.860 --> 07:04.580
Please give us a message for all of the fans in Brazil.

07:06.700 --> 07:09.860
Starting today, I won't be Carlos Balá any longer.

07:12.190 --> 07:13.580
What do you mean by that?

07:14.370 --> 07:18.640
And so, Santana declared an intention to sever his ties with Balá

07:18.640 --> 07:20.810
during the press conference after the game.

07:20.810 --> 07:23.750
As a testament, he had forsaken the Balá name

07:23.750 --> 07:27.040
and returned to his old name, Carlos Santana.

07:27.620 --> 07:30.770
Brazil's soccer star betrays mentor!

07:30.770 --> 07:32.750
This is a huge scoop!

07:39.500 --> 07:43.340
Carlos! What were you thinking when you blabbered that nonsense?!

07:46.960 --> 07:51.970
I'm just playing soccer at God's will.

07:52.700 --> 07:55.300
Stop the nonsense!

07:55.890 --> 08:00.660
Are you betraying me? Who raised you to what you are now?

08:04.090 --> 08:07.660
Soccer is the only thing God has left me.

08:08.850 --> 08:12.660
I don't need anything but soccer.

08:14.290 --> 08:19.180
So Balá, I no longer need you.

08:21.250 --> 08:23.420
Carlos... why you...

08:23.420 --> 08:25.280
Where are you going? Wait!

08:26.480 --> 08:27.900
Santana...

08:32.700 --> 08:37.950
After that, Santana transferred from Balá FC to FC Domingo.

08:39.470 --> 08:44.800
He gave up everything other than soccer to gain more power.

08:47.740 --> 08:50.220
The game resumes with Brancos in possession of the ball.

08:50.220 --> 08:54.220
The Son of God Santana's Domingo has finally taken the lead.

08:56.220 --> 09:00.870
It can be said that Santana got all four Domingo goals by himself.

09:00.870 --> 09:05.740
He certainly is blessed with special powers from God.

09:15.300 --> 09:17.110
The ball is quickly passed to Tsubasa.

09:17.110 --> 09:18.340
All right!

09:18.340 --> 09:21.300
Santana sees it and quickly closes in!

09:22.630 --> 09:25.320
You haven't seen my true power yet.

09:32.150 --> 09:34.340
The absolute power given to me by God...

09:34.340 --> 09:38.060
is my strength!

09:47.280 --> 09:49.940
Tsubasa! Let's show them Brancos' teamwork!

09:50.430 --> 09:51.270
Okay!

09:51.940 --> 09:53.190
Let's do it!

09:53.190 --> 09:54.780
Yeah!

09:55.240 --> 09:59.350
Santana didn't notice Giorgino coming?

10:01.650 --> 10:02.460
Nice!

10:02.460 --> 10:05.710
Tsubasa isn't the only player on our team!

10:10.490 --> 10:15.330
The Brancos have become one and advance into Domingo territory!

10:15.330 --> 10:17.580
The Brancos have regained their rhythm.

10:17.580 --> 10:21.260
Raise the line! Don't be afraid of counter attacks!

10:21.260 --> 10:22.260
Go!

10:22.260 --> 10:23.340
There, Tsubasa!

10:25.200 --> 10:26.860
I won't let you get the ball!

10:31.140 --> 10:33.020
Tsubasa lets it go!

10:33.020 --> 10:34.780
Santana was drawn away from the ball!

10:35.770 --> 10:37.340
They're in front of the goal!

10:42.020 --> 10:44.020
It's in! Goal!

10:44.940 --> 10:47.500
Leandro drove it in!

10:47.500 --> 10:51.020
4-4. The score is tied again!

10:54.020 --> 10:56.360
Brancos caught up!

10:56.360 --> 10:59.420
Tsubasa drawing Santana away from the ball was very crucial.

10:59.420 --> 11:04.210
Santana was actually the one who had been preventing goals in decisive moments.

11:06.540 --> 11:11.310
Santana, who turned into a cyborg, is obsessed with Tsubasa.

11:23.290 --> 11:24.610
Santana...

11:30.180 --> 11:33.220
The game resumes with Domingo's possession.

11:34.970 --> 11:38.760
The score is tied 4-4 with little time remaining.

11:38.760 --> 11:40.970
Which team will score next?

11:45.030 --> 11:46.890
The ball reached Leo!

11:53.060 --> 11:56.320
It wasn't like him to play like that.

11:56.320 --> 12:02.030
The usual Santana would've ignored Tsubasa and shot at goal.

12:03.620 --> 12:08.940
Tsubasa may be able to melt Santana's frozen heart.

12:08.940 --> 12:10.350
If so...

12:11.540 --> 12:13.950
Did Leo make a miskick?

12:13.950 --> 12:15.820
The ball flies towards an empty area!

12:25.730 --> 12:27.890
This ball is mine.

12:32.080 --> 12:36.750
Tsubasa may be able to melt Santana's frozen heart.

12:39.060 --> 12:40.310
If so...

12:41.940 --> 12:43.790
Did Leo make a miskick?

12:43.790 --> 12:45.660
The ball flies towards an empty area!

12:45.660 --> 12:49.010
Santana and Tsubasa run towards the landing point!

12:50.700 --> 12:55.220
Tsubasa, please fight Santana - more powerfully and with more intensity!

13:15.060 --> 13:17.960
My soccer is given to me by God.

13:17.960 --> 13:20.180
You don't stand a chance against me.

13:20.950 --> 13:26.860
I can't lose against you! My belief in soccer is on the line!

13:32.010 --> 13:33.580
Tsubasa falls!

13:33.580 --> 13:35.900
But Sergio picks up the ball.

13:38.490 --> 13:40.300
I will emerge victorious.

13:42.250 --> 13:44.500
I'll definitely beat you!

13:44.500 --> 13:45.980
Let's go, Santana!

13:45.980 --> 13:48.340
This is our last battle!

13:48.760 --> 13:53.210
Santana approaches Brancos' offensive line!

13:53.820 --> 13:56.180
It's already into the added time!

13:56.710 --> 13:59.180
This is the final attack!

13:59.180 --> 14:01.660
Santana, go into the front line and wait for us!

14:03.500 --> 14:06.690
Cover Tsubasa! Don't give him space!

14:06.690 --> 14:09.100
Pass the ball to Santana!

14:12.180 --> 14:15.940
That's right! We're always playing as a team!

14:15.940 --> 14:18.220
Even Santana isn't alone.

14:18.780 --> 14:22.540
It's just that he's never looked around him.

14:28.460 --> 14:30.340
The ball has been passed to Tsubasa!

14:35.260 --> 14:36.860
Tsubasa feints and dodges!

14:36.860 --> 14:40.030
But Santana is catching up!

14:40.030 --> 14:42.460
He's running straight towards Tsubasa and the ball!

14:42.460 --> 14:43.180
Santana!

14:44.780 --> 14:46.860
I'll stop you.

14:46.860 --> 14:48.300
Santana!

14:48.300 --> 14:50.100
I will win.

14:56.820 --> 14:57.420
It's not over!

14:57.810 --> 14:58.940
Tsubasa gets into shooting position!

14:58.940 --> 15:00.220
It's not over!

15:00.220 --> 15:02.220
Santana goes to block!

15:07.700 --> 15:08.780
Nice pass!

15:08.780 --> 15:10.100
Shoot! Leandro!

15:11.030 --> 15:11.900
I got this!

15:11.900 --> 15:12.740
Leandro shoots!

15:12.740 --> 15:13.620
It's not over!

15:15.290 --> 15:17.270
He stopped it!

15:19.420 --> 15:21.540
Take this, Santana!

15:26.670 --> 15:29.380
He scored! Goal!

15:32.840 --> 15:36.080
There goes the final whistle!

15:38.730 --> 15:41.600
This is, indeed, the decisive goal.

15:41.600 --> 15:45.580
Santana, the Perfect Soldier Soccer Cyborg, is defeated!

15:45.580 --> 15:47.580
That was amazing, Tsubasa!

15:47.580 --> 15:49.570
Nice, Tsubasa!

15:49.570 --> 15:50.470
Tsubasa.

15:51.760 --> 15:53.940
Well done, Tsubasa.

15:54.530 --> 15:55.550
Thanks!

16:02.100 --> 16:06.610
It can be said that Brancos' teamwork has defeated Santana, the Son of God.

16:06.610 --> 16:11.890
If they can keep up their focus like today, they may even win the championship.

16:11.890 --> 16:15.440
This could be a very promising season for Brancos!

16:44.590 --> 16:47.020
Tsubasa is an amazing player.

16:49.120 --> 16:53.160
He never gives up... hot on our heels the whole time.

16:57.030 --> 17:00.620
He even heated up the Soccer Cyborg in the end.

17:04.350 --> 17:06.510
We'll get to play against him again.

17:08.090 --> 17:08.890
Leo.

17:12.350 --> 17:14.940
I will definitely defeat Tsubasa next time.

17:14.940 --> 17:16.010
So...

17:16.750 --> 17:18.620
Please help me out.

17:22.780 --> 17:26.660
Yeah, I will. Just like the old days.

17:28.680 --> 17:30.130
Santana...

18:11.820 --> 18:27.180
Tsubasa! Tsubasa! Tsubasa!

18:11.820 --> 18:16.350
The playoff berth and the state championship are at stake, Brancos vs Domingo.

18:16.350 --> 18:17.820
This is the last match of the season.

18:17.820 --> 18:23.410
Brancos has finally taken the lead with 10 minutes remaining!

18:23.410 --> 18:27.180
The goal scorer is, of course, Brancos Number 10, Tsubasa Ohzora!

18:33.540 --> 18:35.060
Nice shot!

18:38.780 --> 18:40.360
Tsubasa.

18:40.360 --> 18:43.920
Your last game in Brazil is almost over.

18:43.920 --> 18:46.410
You have become a truly magnificent player.

18:46.410 --> 18:49.050
I have nothing left to teach you.

18:49.050 --> 18:53.120
Win this game, become Number One in Brazil,

18:53.120 --> 18:56.060
and take your game to Europe!

18:58.950 --> 19:01.620
The game resumes with Domingo's kickoff.

19:02.190 --> 19:05.680
Tsubasa, it was really fun playing with you.

19:05.680 --> 19:06.660
Ten minutes left!

19:09.010 --> 19:12.460
I'll enjoy this match to the fullest!

19:13.520 --> 19:14.510
Tsubasa!

19:14.510 --> 19:17.460
I swear that I'll succeed you as the Number 10 of the team!

19:17.460 --> 19:19.720
What are you talking about? We're in middle of a game!

19:23.220 --> 19:25.380
I just wanted to say it!

19:27.960 --> 19:30.900
Oh, did the last goal turn the tide?

19:30.900 --> 19:32.460
Brancos are starting to move better!

19:32.460 --> 19:35.980
Another goal, and their victory will be certain!

19:45.180 --> 19:46.020
Tsubasa!

19:50.740 --> 19:53.220
Leo clears away the ball meant for Tsubasa!

19:53.230 --> 19:56.020
Good, now we can stop their momentum.

19:56.680 --> 20:00.300
Domingo is substituting players now.

20:04.270 --> 20:07.630
Dear God, I thank you from the bottom of my heart...

20:07.630 --> 20:11.030
for arranging my encounter with Ohzora Tsubasa.

20:12.100 --> 20:31.600
Santana! Santana! Santana!

20:17.020 --> 20:18.540
Santana.

20:18.540 --> 20:21.660
I can't believe it! It's Santana!

20:22.110 --> 20:27.470
He was injured few games ago and rumored to be out for the season!

20:27.470 --> 20:31.600
Carlos Santana makes his appearance in the nick of time!

20:31.600 --> 20:48.220
Santana! Santana! Santana!

20:31.600 --> 20:33.250
You showed up, as I expected.

20:33.250 --> 20:34.550
Of course I would.

20:34.550 --> 20:39.110
How can I not appear in the game in which the state championship is at stake?

20:44.450 --> 20:48.220
Tsubasa, I won't let you have all the fun in soccer!

20:49.010 --> 20:52.610
I can almost see the sparks flying between Santana and Tsubasa!

20:52.610 --> 20:59.550
These two are the stars of great matches this season between Brancos and Domingo!

21:00.270 --> 21:01.700
The game resumes!

21:02.110 --> 21:03.140
Let's go, Leo!

21:03.140 --> 21:03.920
Yeah!

21:05.800 --> 21:09.420
They are both top star players in Brazil now!

21:09.420 --> 21:10.940
Here I come, Santana!

21:23.980 --> 21:27.020
Santana! His famous move, the Santana Turn!

21:37.460 --> 21:40.340
I was able to improve as a player,

21:40.340 --> 21:45.770
thanks to the training by Roberto, Pepe, and Santana in Brazil.

21:46.380 --> 21:49.680
I will win this battle before I leave!

21:49.680 --> 21:54.760
I will go to Europe for further improvement!

22:04.020 --> 22:10.700
Preview

22:05.260 --> 22:08.300
He sets off his journey to Europe in search of a new pitch.

22:08.910 --> 22:11.020
Top class players Tsubasa has never faced before

22:11.020 --> 22:14.300
and unimaginable hardship must be awaiting him.

22:14.300 --> 22:17.780
Shine in the greatest and the biggest stage!

22:17.780 --> 22:20.110
Tsubasa, if it's you, you can do it!

22:20.110 --> 22:24.420
Make your dream of becoming the best player in the world come true!

22:24.420 --> 22:26.180
Next time, on Captain Tsubasa:

22:26.180 --> 22:28.120
The New Stage of Dreams

22:26.340 --> 22:34.060
The New Stage of Dreams

22:28.120 --> 22:29.270
Look forward to it!

22:29.270 --> 22:32.220
Let's aim for tomorrow! Get Goal!

22:37.780 --> 22:44.780
<b>Keep on going mirai ga mieta toki ni</b>

22:37.780 --> 22:44.780
<b>Keep on going, when you saw the future {"Keep on going. When you see the future,}</b>

22:37.780 --> 22:44.780
<b>Keep on going, when you saw the future</b>

22:44.780 --> 22:51.020
<b>arifureta hibi ga kagayakidasu yo</b>

22:44.780 --> 22:51.020
<b>those mundane days are shining forth {Are we not putting punctuation on the ends of lines?}</b>

22:44.780 --> 22:51.020
<b>those mundane days are shining forth</b>

22:51.020 --> 23:03.940
<b>kodou ga hazumu jikan wo kimi to tomo ni hashirou</b>

22:51.020 --> 23:03.940
<b>Our hearts are racing, so let's run together</b>

22:51.020 --> 23:03.940
<b>Our hearts are racing, so let's run together</b>

